# AffectBridge optional secrets template.
#
# Server, ALMA, and local LLM settings live in config.json.
# LM Studio does not require an API key. Copy this file to .env only
# when using a remote provider that requires a secret.
# .env is gitignored. Load it before running the server, e.g.:
#
#   export $(grep -v '^#' .env | xargs)
#   go run ./cmd/server

# Optional API key for a remote provider. LM Studio leaves this empty.
# LLM_API_KEY=
